<title>TANZANIA: Shilling gains on dollar, weakens on pound.</title>
<headline>Shilling gains on dollar, weakens on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling on Thursday appreciated slightly against the dollar, but weakened against the pound, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The Bank of Tanzania said the dollar was trading at a commercial mean rate of 594.0000 compared to 594.3069 on Wednesday, while against the pound the shilling stood at 997.5072 down from Wednesday's rate of 994.3973.</p>
</text>
